{"id":"c6ab46cd662b1409","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-frame.md","title":"GL Frame","display":"df-gl-frame — GL Frame","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-frame","aliases":["89-df-gl-frame"],"display":"df-gl-frame — GL Frame","depends_on":["[[89-df-transitive-frame]]","[[89-df-converse-well-founded]]","[[89-df-kripke-frame]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-frame"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-frame</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-frame — GL Frame"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5c02ba5095698c09\" href=\"?note=5c02ba5095698c09\" title=\"89-df-transitive-frame\">89-df-transitive-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ae4d761acfb9353d\" href=\"?note=ae4d761acfb9353d\" title=\"89-df-converse-well-founded\">89-df-converse-well-founded</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c78d4bf1505bda5c\" href=\"?note=c78d4bf1505bda5c\" title=\"89-df-kripke-frame\">89-df-kripke-frame</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}=(W,R)\">\\(\\mathcal{F}=(W,R)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)\\)</span> is the\nwell-formed-frame predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c78d4bf1505bda5c\" href=\"?note=c78d4bf1505bda5c\" title=\"89-df-kripke-frame\">89-df-kripke-frame</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trans}(\\mathcal F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Trans}(\\mathcal F)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CWF}_{W}(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{CWF}_{W}(R)\\)</span> are the\npredicates from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5c02ba5095698c09\" href=\"?note=5c02ba5095698c09\" title=\"89-df-transitive-frame\">89-df-transitive-frame</a> and\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ae4d761acfb9353d\" href=\"?note=ae4d761acfb9353d\" title=\"89-df-converse-well-founded\">89-df-converse-well-founded</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}frame}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GLFrame}(\\mathcal{F})\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)\\land\n\\mathrm{Trans}(\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathrm{CWF}_{W}(R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}frame}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GLFrame}(\\mathcal{F})\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)\\land\n\\mathrm{Trans}(\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathrm{CWF}_{W}(R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL\\text{-}Frame}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL\\text{-}Frame}\\)</span> : GL框架</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trans}(\\mathcal F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Trans}(\\mathcal F)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>传递 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5c02ba5095698c09\" href=\"?note=5c02ba5095698c09\" title=\"89-df-transitive-frame\">89-df-transitive-frame</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CWF}(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{CWF}(R)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>逆良基 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ae4d761acfb9353d\" href=\"?note=ae4d761acfb9353d\" title=\"89-df-converse-well-founded\">89-df-converse-well-founded</a>)</li>\n<li>传递逆良基框架的整个类别刻画 GL；单个这类框架通常还会验证\n额外公式，不能说它的有效式“恰好”等于 GL。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-transitive-frame","status":"resolved","id":"5c02ba5095698c09","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-transitive-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-converse-well-founded","status":"resolved","id":"ae4d761acfb9353d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-converse-well-founded]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c78d4bf1505bda5c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c78d4bf1505bda5c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{F}=(W,R)$, and $\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)$ is the\nwell-formed-frame predicate from [[89-df-kripke-frame]].","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-transitive-frame","status":"resolved","id":"5c02ba5095698c09","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Trans}(\\mathcal F)$ and $\\mathrm{CWF}_{W}(R)$ are the\npredicates from [[89-df-transitive-frame]] and\n[[89-df-converse-well-founded]].","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-converse-well-founded","status":"resolved","id":"ae4d761acfb9353d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Trans}(\\mathcal F)$ and $\\mathrm{CWF}_{W}(R)$ are the\npredicates from [[89-df-transitive-frame]] and\n[[89-df-converse-well-founded]].","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-transitive-frame","status":"resolved","id":"5c02ba5095698c09","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Trans}(\\mathcal F)$ : $R$传递 (see [[89-df-transitive-frame]])","embed":false},{"target":"89-df